OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor pool extends season in
OL,4,A'summer of sunshine'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn outdoor swimming pool is to extend
OL,7,Fits summer season following a
OL,8,Frecord-breaking number of visitors.
OL,10,FThe open air pool in Woodstock,
OL,11,FOxfordshire, had more than 9,000 people
OL,12,Fattend by the end of July, compared
OL,13,Fwith 3,039 during the same period last
OL,14,Fyear.
OL,16,FWest Oxfordshire District Council said
OL,17,Fdue to a "summer of sunshine and
OL,18,Fsold-out sessions" cool water swimming
OL,19,Fat the site will be available from 31
OL,20,FAugust until 27 September, with
OL,21,Fpossible further extensions if the
OL,22,Fweather remained warm.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
