OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor pool extends season in
OL,4,A'summer of sunshine'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe summer has seen several heatwaves
OL,7,Fin the region, with the Met Office
OL,8,Fsaying it is likely to be the hottest
OL,9,Fon record.
